<title>POLAND: AMERBANK MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.93 vs    0.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.52 vs    1.28</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.91 vs    3.22</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 7.00 vs    4.14</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.13 vs    2.98</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    7.03 vs    5.13</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 22.54 vs   15.34</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	30.02 vs   20.14</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Amerykanski w</p>
<p>Polsce SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
